{"id":1235,"date":"2021-03-26T00:43:25","date_gmt":"2021-03-26T00:43:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=1235"},"modified":"2021-03-26T06:20:37","modified_gmt":"2021-03-26T06:20:37","slug":"rdrc-re-cap-rdrc-interise-amplified-queens-streetwise-mba-program","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-re-cap-rdrc-interise-amplified-queens-streetwise-mba-program\/","title":{"rendered":"Re-Cap: RDRC\/Interise Amplified Queens Streetwise MBA Program"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">RDRC\/Interise Amplify Queens StreetWise MBA Champions<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Launched, May 25th 2020, the Amplify Queens StreetWise MBA Program, designed to advance Queens Businesses economic growth, is coming to an end. The seven-month program, powered by Interise, with the financial support of Santander Bank, provided the methodologies, resources and tools for Queens-based small business owners wanting to get out of isolation, work\u00a0<em>on<\/em>\u00a0their business (not just\u00a0<em>in<\/em>\u00a0it), and pivot to the next level, did just that for 13 businesses.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Click <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/rdrc-interise-queens-amplified-women-of-the-month\/\">Here<\/a><\/span> For AQS Businesses Highlighted<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">On Tuesday, March 23rd, guest experts included: <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Brian Yeung, Business AdvisorYork College SBDC<\/span>; <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Kimberly Hardy, Director of MWBE Participation-PMO, JFK New Terminal One<\/span>; <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Nancy Fox,\u00a0<em>Grants Manager,\u00a0<\/em>Episcopal Health Services Inc St. John\u2019s Episcopal Hospital<\/span>; <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Deborah Mackler-Gordon, Director of Construction, Episcopal Health Services Inc. St. John\u2019s Episcopal Hospital<\/span>; and <span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Wayne Green, a guest expert on procurement<\/span>, gave businesses resources, strategies, insights, motivation, and individualized Strategic Growth Action Plans, outlining the actions and steps required to achieve their business goals.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The program&#8217;s foundation lies in Interise\u2019s StreetWise \u2018MBA\u2019\u2122, a nationally recognized, award-winning curriculum designed to accelerate existing small businesses&#8217; growth, using a peer-learning method, industry experts, business peers, with instructor insights and strategies, to provide small business owners with the knowledge, know-how, and networks necessary to grow and scale.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">To learn more about the Amplify Queens Streetwise MGA Program and visit:\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/programs.interise.org\/rdrc-amplify-queens\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Amplify Queens Streetwise MBA Program<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><strong>Partners<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The\u00a0<em>Amplify Queens<\/em>\u00a0program is the result of\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"http:\/\/rdrc.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>RDRC\u2019s<\/u><\/a><\/span>\u00a0partnership with\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/interise.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Interise<\/u><\/a><\/span>,\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.santanderbank.com\/us\/business\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Santander Bank<\/u><\/a>